<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <title>Vaishnavi Wasule | Portfolio</title>
  <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Poppins:wght@300;500;700&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
  <style>
    * {
      margin: 0;
      padding: 0;
      box-sizing: border-box;
      font-family: 'Poppins', sans-serif;
    }

    body {
      background: linear-gradient(120deg, #1e3c72, #2a5298);
      color: #fff;
    }

    header {
      padding: 20px 50px;
      display: flex;
      justify-content: space-between;
      align-items: center;
      background: rgba(0,0,0,0.3);
    }

    header h1 {
      font-size: 24px;
    }

    nav a {
      color: #fff;
      margin-left: 20px;
      text-decoration: none;
      font-weight: 500;
    }

    nav a:hover {
      color: #ffcc70;
    }

    .hero {
      height: 90vh;
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
      text-align: center;
      flex-direction: column;
    }

    .hero h2 {
      font-size: 48px;
    }

    .hero p {
      margin-top: 10px;
      font-size: 20px;
      opacity: 0.9;
    }

    .btn {
      margin-top: 20px;
      padding: 12px 25px;
      border: none;
      background: #ffcc70;
      color: #000;
      cursor: pointer;
      border-radius: 25px;
      font-weight: bold;
    }

    section {
      padding: 60px 50px;
    }

    .about, .projects, .contact {
      background: rgba(0,0,0,0.2);
      margin: 20px;
      border-radius: 15px;
    }

    h3 {
      margin-bottom: 20px;
      font-size: 28px;
    }

    .projects-grid {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(250px, 1fr));
      gap: 20px;
    }

    .card {
      background: #fff;
      color: #000;
      padding: 20px;
      border-radius: 10px;
      transition: transform 0.3s;
    }

    .card:hover {
      transform: scale(1.05);
    }

    footer {
      text-align: center;
      padding: 20px;
      background: rgba(0,0,0,0.3);
      margin-top: 30px;
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>

<header>
  <h1>Vaishnavi Wasule</h1>
  <nav>
    <a href="#about">About</a>
    <a href="#projects">Projects</a>
    <a href="#contact">Contact</a>
  </nav>
</header>

<div class="hero">
  <h2>Hello, I'm Vaishnavi 👩‍💻</h2>
  <p>A passionate student & aspiring developer</p>
  <button class="btn">View My Work</button>
</div>

<section id="about" class="about">
  <h3>About Me</h3>
  <p>
    I am Vaishnavi Wasule, a passionate student from Symbiosis Institute of technology.I enjoy building websites and learning new skills to grow as a developer.I am currently learning the fundamentals and working on developing my skills in areas like programming, problem-solving, and project development. I am enthusiastic about building real-world solutions and expanding my knowledge step by step.As a first year undergraduate student driven by curiosity and a desire to grow. I aim to build a strong foundation in my field while actively seeking opportunities to learn, create, and contribute. I believe in continuous improvement and look forward to shaping my future through knowledge and experience.
  </p>
</section>

