Created a travel blog website to showcase destinations, stories, and experiences. 
This project helped me strengthen my skills in structuring web pages using HTML and CSS, organizing content effectively, and designing visually appealing layouts. I also learned the importance of user-friendly navigation and content presentation.</p>
