Built a basic shopping website with product listings and a simple cart interface. Through this project, I gained experience in integrating frontend components, managing user interactions, and understanding the fundamentals of e-commerce workflows. It also improved my problem-solving skills and knowledge of website functionality.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section id="contact" class="contact">
  <h3>Contact Me</h3>
  <p>Email: vaishnavi21@gmail.com</p>
  <p>Phone: 9685421478</p>
</section>

<footer>
  <p>© 2026 Vaishnavi Wasule | Portfolio</p>
</footer>

</body>
</html>
